  "changelog": "Initial release of guaikei-xhs-content-collector.\n\n- Provides public data collection for Xiaohongshu (\u5c0f\u7ea2\u4e66) including note search, note detail, comment fetch, and creator works monitoring.\n- Command-line interface with four core scripts for different tasks: keyword search, note detail + comments, creator posts, and comment-only extraction.\n- No need for login; processes only public data with high safety and up to 10,000 entries per run.\n- Includes clear routing, parameter rules, input requirements, and error handling guidance.\n- Requires GUAIKEI_API_TOKEN environment variable for API access.\n- Not applicable to non-Xiaohongshu platforms or private/account data.",
